     * structurally). Natively JS anchors it at the page bottom (~2547..2703):

     * mostly behind the floating liquid bar and partly offscreen. The strip's

     * bottom is re-pinned just above the glass top (JD_CHECKOUT_BOTTOM_GAP_PX,

     * cart page only). Lift via offsetTopAndBottom so drawing AND the touch

     * region move together; RN re-renders that reset the offset are

     * re-corrected by the layout/preDraw correctors.

     */

    private fun liftJdCheckoutBar(root: ViewGroup, rootHeight: Int) {

        val rootWidth = root.width

        if (rootWidth <= 0 || rootHeight <= 0) return

        var bar = jdCheckoutBar?.get()

